<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8fcf9">
  <meta name="description" content="Block chosen websites for a set time, or set one shared usage reminder, with the DeepSprout Chrome extension.">
  <title>Digital Shield — DeepSprout</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="../../../../assets/home-kit/icons/brand-sprout-logo.svg">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../../../src/styles/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../../../src/layouts/member-layout/member-layout.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../../../src/styles/page-hero.css?v=20261014-1">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../../../src/styles/individual-ui.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="shield.css?v=20261101-1">
  
  <script src="../../../js/data/personal-access.js" defer></script>
  <script src="../../../../src/js/data/account.js" defer></script>
  <script src="../../../../src/layouts/member-layout/member-layout.js" defer></script>
  <script src="../../../js/data/shield-bridge.js" defer></script>
  <script src="../../../../src/js/ui/individual-ui.js" defer></script>
  <script src="shield.js?v=20261101-1" defer></script>
</head>
<body data-page="shield" data-root="../../../../">
  <div data-site-header></div>
  <main class="shield-page">
    <header class="ds-hero" aria-labelledby="shield-title">
      <div class="ds-hero-copy">
        <p class="ds-hero-eyebrow">Digital Shield</p>
        <h1 id="shield-title">Make space for<br><em>what matters.</em></h1>
        <p class="ds-hero-text">Choose the sites. Set your boundary. Get back to your day.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="ds-hero-art" style="--hero-focus: 62% 50%"><img src="../../../../assets/shield/hero-bimo.png" alt="Azm relaxing on a grassy hill with sunglasses"></figure>
    </header>
    <svg class="sh-defs" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <symbol id="sh-shield" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 5 6v5.5c0 4.3 2.9 8 7 9.5 4.1-1.5 7-5.2 7-9.5V6l-7-3Z"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-10"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-plug" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 3v5m6-5v5M7 8h10v3a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V8Zm5 8v5"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="10.5" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-bell" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 16V11a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v5l1.5 2h-15L6 16Z"/><path d="M10 20a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-alert" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4 2.5 20h19L12 4Z"/><path d="M12 10v4m0 3v.5"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-minus" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 12h12"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-plus" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 6v12M6 12h12"/></symbol>
      <symbol id="sh-basket" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 10h18l-1.8 9.2a2 2 0 0 1-2 1.6H6.8a2 2 0 0 1-2-1.6L3 10Zm4.5 0L11 4m5.5 6L13 4M9 14v3m6-3v3"/></symbol>
    </svg>

    <section class="sh-status" id="shield-status" aria-labelledby="connection-title" data-state="checking">
      <div class="sh-status-main">
        <span class="sh-status-orb" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#sh-shield"/></svg></span>
        <div class="sh-status-copy">
          <p class="sh-kicker" id="connection-title">Browser connection</p>
          <p class="sh-state" id="connection-state" role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking extension…</p>
          <p class="sh-detail" id="connection-detail"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="sh-status-actions"><button type="button" class="sh-quiet" id="refresh-status">Refresh status</button><button type="button" class="sh-quiet" id="disconnect-extension" disabled>Disconnect account</button></div>
      </div>
      <ol class="sh-steps" aria-label="Setup">
        <li data-step="install"><span><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-check"/></svg></span>Install the extension</li>
        <li data-step="pair"><span><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-check"/></svg></span>Pair it with your account</li>
        <li data-step="use"><span><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-check"/></svg></span>Protect or set a reminder</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="sh-setup" id="shield-setup">
        <details id="installation-guide" class="sh-guide"><summary>Installation guide · Chrome 120+</summary><ol><li>Open the repository folder <code>extensions/digital-shield</code>.</li><li>In Chrome, open <code>chrome://extensions</code>, enable Developer mode and choose <strong>Load unpacked</strong>. Select that folder containing manifest.json. Extract any ZIP first.</li><li>Use this site at <code>http://127.0.0.1:8897</code> or <code>http://localhost:8897</code>. Other origins and incognito are unsupported.</li><li>Open the extension popup, create a pairing code and paste it below. Pair only with your own active Individual account.</li></ol><p>After an extension update or reload, reload this page. If permissions were removed, restore site access in Chrome’s extension details, then use Refresh status. Removing the extension, other browsers and other devices bypass protection.</p><a href="https://github.com/ahmadfa100/DeepSprout/tree/main/extensions/digital-shield">Setup, privacy and troubleshooting</a></details>
        <form id="connect-form" class="sh-pair"><label for="pairing-code">Pairing code from the extension popup</label><div class="shield-row"><input id="pairing-code" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="32" minlength="32" required pattern="[a-f0-9]{32}" placeholder="32-character code"><button type="submit" class="ds-btn">Connect extension</button></div></form>
      </div>
      <p class="sh-message" id="bridge-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>

    <div class="shield-features">
      <section class="shield-feature sh-card" aria-labelledby="protection-title" data-feature="protection" id="protection-card">
        <header class="sh-card-head"><span class="sh-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#sh-lock"/></svg></span><div><p class="sh-kicker">01 · Focus session</p><h2 id="protection-title">Put distractions away</h2><p class="sh-lede">Drop the apps that pull you away into the basket, set a time, and start.</p></div></header>
        <div class="sh-live" id="protection-live" hidden>
          <div class="sh-live-ring"><span class="sh-dial-ticks" aria-hidden="true"></span><svg viewBox="0 0 260 260" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="sh-live-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#5fb37f"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#123f34"/></linearGradient></defs><circle class="sh-live-track" cx="130" cy="130" r="112"/><circle class="sh-live-fill" id="protection-ring" cx="130" cy="130" r="112" pathLength="100"/></svg>
            <div class="sh-live-center"><p class="sh-live-label"><span class="ds-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Focus on</p><p id="protection-countdown" role="timer"></p><p class="sh-live-phase" id="protection-live-phase">Remaining</p></div></div>
          <div class="sh-live-side"><p class="sh-kicker">Blocked right now</p><div class="sh-live-icons" id="protection-live-icons" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="sh-live-sites" id="protection-live-sites"></p><button type="button" class="ds-btn sh-stop" data-variant="secondary" data-size="sm" id="stop-protection" disabled>Stop protection early…</button></div>
        </div>
        <form id="protection-form" class="sh-grid">
          <div class="sh-col">
            <fieldset id="protection-sites" class="sh-sites"><legend><span class="sh-step">1</span>Choose apps <small>Tap an app or drag it into the basket</small></legend><div class="sh-site-picker" id="protection-picker"></div></fieldset>
            <div class="sh-basket" id="protection-tray" data-group="protection" aria-label="Apps in this focus session"><span class="sh-basket-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="sh-basket-body"><div class="sh-basket-head"><span class="sh-basket-title"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-basket"/></svg>Focus basket</span><span id="protection-count" class="sh-count"></span></div><div class="sh-tray-items" id="protection-tray-items"></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sh-col sh-col-time">
            <div class="sh-field"><label for="protection-duration"><span class="sh-step">2</span>Set the time</label>
              <div class="sh-dial" id="protection-dial" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sh-dial-ticks"></span><svg class="sh-dial-svg" viewBox="0 0 200 200"><circle class="sh-dial-track" cx="100" cy="100" r="84"/><circle class="sh-dial-fill" id="protection-dial-fill" cx="100" cy="100" r="84" pathLength="100"/></svg><span class="sh-dial-knob" id="protection-dial-knob"><i></i></span><span class="sh-dial-center"><strong id="protection-dial-value">0</strong><span>minutes</span><small id="protection-dial-note"></small></span></div>
              <div class="sh-time-controls"><div class="sh-stepper"><button type="button" data-nudge="-5" data-for="protection-duration" aria-label="5 minutes less"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-minus"/></svg></button><input id="protection-duration" type="number" min="1" max="120" value="25" step="1" required aria-label="Minutes, 1 to 120" aria-describedby="protection-scope"><button type="button" data-nudge="5" data-for="protection-duration" aria-label="5 minutes more"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-plus"/></svg></button></div>
              <div class="sh-presets" role="group" aria-label="Quick durations"><button type="button" data-duration="15">15</button><button type="button" data-duration="25">25</button><button type="button" data-duration="45">45</button><button type="button" data-duration="60">60</button><button type="button" data-duration="90">90</button></div></div></div>
            <p id="protection-summary" class="sh-summary" aria-live="polite"></p>
            <div class="sh-review"><label class="shield-check sh-consent"><input type="checkbox" id="protection-consent" required> Block the entire selected sites in this Chrome profile.</label><p id="protection-scope" class="sh-fine">Open pages need a reload. <button type="button" class="ds-help" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="About what protection covers" data-help="Protection blocks new page loads on the selected websites and all their subdomains in this Chrome profile. This includes ordinary YouTube videos and Instagram messages. Media already loaded keeps playing until you reload. You can stop early at any time; it is not uninstall-proof."><span aria-hidden="true">?</span></button></p></div>
            <button type="submit" class="ds-btn sh-start" id="start-protection" disabled>Start focus session <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-arrow"/></svg></button>
            <p class="sh-state-line" id="protection-state" role="status">Connect to verify protection state.</p>
          </div>
        </form>
        <p class="sh-message" id="protection-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </section>

      <section class="shield-feature sh-card" aria-labelledby="reminder-title" data-feature="reminder" id="reminder-card">
        <header class="sh-card-head"><span class="sh-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#sh-bell"/></svg></span><div><p class="sh-kicker">02 · Gentle reminder</p><h2 id="reminder-title">Notice your time</h2><p class="sh-lede">Get one nudge when time across the apps in this basket adds up.</p></div></header>
        <form id="reminder-form" class="sh-grid">
          <div class="sh-col">
            <fieldset id="reminder-sites" class="sh-sites"><legend><span class="sh-step">1</span>Choose apps <small>Their time is counted together</small></legend><div class="sh-site-picker" id="reminder-picker"></div></fieldset>
            <div class="sh-basket" id="reminder-tray" data-group="reminder" aria-label="Apps counted for the reminder"><span class="sh-basket-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="sh-basket-body"><div class="sh-basket-head"><span class="sh-basket-title"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-basket"/></svg>Reminder basket</span><span id="reminder-count" class="sh-count"></span></div><div class="sh-tray-items" id="reminder-tray-items"></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sh-col sh-col-time">
            <div class="sh-field"><label for="reminder-threshold"><span class="sh-step">2</span>Remind me after</label>
              <div class="sh-dial" id="reminder-dial" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sh-dial-ticks"></span><svg class="sh-dial-svg" viewBox="0 0 200 200"><circle class="sh-dial-track" cx="100" cy="100" r="84"/><circle class="sh-dial-fill" id="reminder-dial-fill" cx="100" cy="100" r="84" pathLength="100"/></svg><span class="sh-dial-knob" id="reminder-dial-knob"><i></i></span><span class="sh-dial-center"><strong id="reminder-dial-value">0</strong><span>min a day</span><small id="reminder-dial-note"></small></span></div>
              <div class="sh-time-controls"><div class="sh-stepper"><button type="button" data-nudge="-5" data-for="reminder-threshold" aria-label="5 minutes less"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-minus"/></svg></button><input id="reminder-threshold" type="number" min="1" max="240" step="1" value="30" required aria-label="Minutes per day, 1 to 240"><button type="button" data-nudge="5" data-for="reminder-threshold" aria-label="5 minutes more"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-plus"/></svg></button></div>
              <div class="sh-presets" role="group" aria-label="Quick thresholds"><button type="button" data-threshold="15">15</button><button type="button" data-threshold="30">30</button><button type="button" data-threshold="60">60</button><button type="button" data-threshold="90">90</button><button type="button" data-threshold="120">120</button></div></div></div>
            <div class="sh-today"><p class="sh-today-label">Today in this browser <button type="button" class="ds-help" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="About how time is counted" data-help="Time adds up across all the websites you select, counted only while a selected site is the active tab in a focused Chrome window and you are not idle. It does not measure Reels, attention, phone apps or all screen time. Missing time is unknown, never zero."><span aria-hidden="true">?</span></button></p><p id="reminder-usage">No browser usage data available.</p><div class="ds-meter-track sh-today-meter" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ds-meter-fill" id="reminder-meter" style="--value:0"></span></div><details class="sh-coverage"><summary>Measurement details</summary><p id="reminder-coverage" class="sh-fine"></p></details></div>
            <label class="shield-check sh-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="reminder-enabled" checked><span class="sh-switch" aria-hidden="true"></span> Reminder on</label>
            <button type="submit" class="ds-btn sh-start" id="save-reminder" disabled>Save reminder <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-arrow"/></svg></button>
            <p class="sh-state-line" id="reminder-state" role="status">Connect to verify reminder state.</p>
          </div>
        </form>
        <p class="sh-message" id="reminder-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><a class="ds-link" href="../insights/insights.html#usage">See your website time in Insights <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#sh-arrow"/></svg></a>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="sh-more">
      <details class="shield-history ds-disclosure"><summary>Privacy, measurement limits and local history</summary><div class="ds-disclosure-body"><p>Only selected-domain identifiers, aggregate eligible seconds, local period/timezone, coverage, configuration and session events are stored. Full URLs, search terms and unrelated browsing history are not retained or shared with partner workspaces. Records are browser-local and editable by the device owner; they are not server-verified.</p><p>Only consecutive observations of an active selected tab, a focused non-minimized window and Chrome’s active idle state count. Suspension, shutdown, unsupported pages and uncertain intervals are excluded. Missing data is unknown, never proof of zero use. A single reminder acknowledgement applies per local day and timezone, even after a threshold change.</p><ul id="shield-history"></ul></div></details>
      <details class="sh-legacy"><summary id="legacy-title">Earlier evening preference</summary><div class="sh-legacy-body"><p>Saved only. This does not schedule a block or notification.</p><form id="shield-form"><label for="shield-time">Evening time</label><input id="shield-time" type="time" value="19:00" required><label class="shield-check"><input id="shield-reminder" type="checkbox"> Saved reminder preference (inactive)</label></form><button form="shield-form" type="submit" class="ds-btn" data-variant="secondary" data-size="sm">Save preferences</button><p class="sh-message" id="save-message" role="status"></p></div></details>
    </div>
  </main>
  <div data-site-footer></div>
</body>
</html>
